format 1
adapter chat 1
npc: npc-demo

node chat-demo-greeting
kind: greeting
pose: greet
title: Chat with Demo

    Hello there.

    What would you like to talk about?

reply: the lesson -> chat-demo-lesson
reply: something else -> chat-demo-bye
reply: Open the atom -> chat-demo-bye => entry atom
link: See my progress => app

node chat-demo-lesson
kind: reply
pose: explain

    A lesson is a short story. (Not a long one.)

react: love -> chat-demo-bye
sticker: nerd -> chat-demo-bye

node chat-demo-bye
kind: sign_off
pose: proud

    Bye for now.

react: love
sticker: nerd
